                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48cf774c-f4df-3729-b716-947ea4c18696",
                        "entry_id": "5896426c-43da-3bb5-a3df-fd8e8bdb086e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gain, avantage, profit tiré d'une activité quelconque."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "eb6fa9f8-e67c-4cf7-9601-b8b245452187",
                                "sense_id": "48cf774c-f4df-3729-b716-947ea4c18696",
                                "text": "Arme offensive ou défensive, la procédure n'est plus pour lui, comme autrefois, un objet de lucre."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6fc06180-e205-310d-84b8-88b49a34f0a9",
                        "entry_id": "5896426c-43da-3bb5-a3df-fd8e8bdb086e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Profit plus ou moins licite que l’on recherche dans une entreprise."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5559db12-8e3d-48c2-890e-47e785eadf6a",
                                "sense_id": "6fc06180-e205-310d-84b8-88b49a34f0a9",
                                "text": "Il fut le promoteur de la loi Claudia, destinée à contenir chez les sénateurs l’esprit de lucre dont ils se laissaient envahir […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c32d76e-8516-4755-83c3-b6ecce93632d",
                                "sense_id": "6fc06180-e205-310d-84b8-88b49a34f0a9",
                                "text": "La coopération de consommation est la seule que nous envisagions ici […] Représentons-nous donc une société de consommateurs qui se sont entendus pour acheter en gros les denrées qui leur sont nécessaires […] Périodiquement, elle leur restitue […] le surplus que lui laissent ses opérations après paiement des frais généraux, de l’intérêt fixe du capital, etc. : je dis surplus, ou trop-perçu, et non pas bénéfice, car la société, théoriquement, ne fait pas acte de commerce et ne poursuit pas un but de lucre, bien qu’en pratique elle prenne forcément le caractère commercial […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cbe43cc6-f368-43e5-919d-beed749633a1",
                                "sense_id": "6fc06180-e205-310d-84b8-88b49a34f0a9",
                                "text": "Le Chartrain est cupide, apathique et salace, répliqua l’abbé Plomb ; cupide surtout, car la passion du lucre est ici, sous des dehors inertes, féroce."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63fd3c6b-8f81-45e4-a60c-b157113d80f2",
                                "sense_id": "6fc06180-e205-310d-84b8-88b49a34f0a9",
                                "text": "Avec la restauration de la famille, (en tant que « cellule sociale ») de l’héritage, et du legs, le goût du lucre, de la possession particulière, reprennent le pas sur le besoin de camaraderie, de partage et de vie commune."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b2706ed-966a-4688-aa36-e91a14538e7c",
                                "sense_id": "6fc06180-e205-310d-84b8-88b49a34f0a9",
                                "text": "Mais ce n’est pas seulement par goût de la tyrannie que les policiers agissaient ainsi, c’est aussi par goût du lucre. Les tracasseries, le « chantage » qu’ils exerçaient sur les juifs apeurés avaient pour but de leur extorquer de fréquentes « étrennes »."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "741b086d-f714-402b-a6b7-045d97e26c46",
                        "source_entry_id": "5896426c-43da-3bb5-a3df-fd8e8bdb086e",
                        "target_lang_word": "lucre",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lucre",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "348083d7-a826-3884-bdb1-471ebfc7ebff",
                                        "entry_id": "aab859ec-9c09-3844-bbbb-5d88d0421f20",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Money, riches, or wealth, especially when seen as having a corrupting effect or causing greed, or obtained in an underhanded manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c56ea26-8a45-48a2-8d32-819eaa608109",
                                                "sense_id": "348083d7-a826-3884-bdb1-471ebfc7ebff",
                                                "text": "A Biſhop then muſt be blameleſſe, the huſband of one wife, vigilant, sober, of good behauiour, giuen to hoſpitalitie, apt to teach; / Not giuen to wine, no ſtriker, not greedy of filthy lucre, but patient, not a brawler, not couetous; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0a888bf-d847-45c6-9dea-6d8fb4c8c82e",
                                                "sense_id": "348083d7-a826-3884-bdb1-471ebfc7ebff",
                                                "text": "By-ends and Silver-Demas both agree; / One calls, the other runs, that he may be / A ſharer in his lucre; ſo theſe two / Take up in this World, and no further go."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ff698ff-c67f-4d0a-ab47-03d879ab5ac0",
                                                "sense_id": "348083d7-a826-3884-bdb1-471ebfc7ebff",
                                                "text": "When a man bargains for the price of maintaining such or such principles, or of endeavouring to make out such or such a case, without believing in the soundness of the principles or the truth of the case; such a man, whether he touch the cash (or paper-money) before or after the performance of his work, and whether he work with his tongue or his pen, may, I think be fairly charged with seeking after \"base lucre;\" for he, in such case, manifestly sells not only the use of his talents, but his sincerity into the bargain, and drives a traffic as nearly allied to soul-selling as any thing in this world can be; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02d369d1-9261-4a80-b32b-620bc9491df7",
                                                "sense_id": "348083d7-a826-3884-bdb1-471ebfc7ebff",
                                                "text": "[…] [I]t's only fair that you should pocket the lucre. I've had my share already."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "97ccd506-c066-4a54-94d1-a1d2bb265285",
                        "source_entry_id": "5896426c-43da-3bb5-a3df-fd8e8bdb086e",
                        "target_lang_word": "profit",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "profit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                        "entry_id": "ba5bd138-66de-3752-b024-b25ff915f061",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Total income or cash flow minus expenditures. The money or other benefit a non-governmental organization or individual receives in exchange for products and services sold at an advertised price."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "864e75ed-056d-4ebb-91a8-f971e44bca34",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "Let no man anticipate uncertain profits."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a01aa129-aafb-43a4-9cad-4d4581fc38d3",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "War is a racket. It always has been. It is possibly the oldest, easily the most profitable, surely the most vicious. It is the only one international in scope. It is the only one in which the profits are reckoned in dollars and the losses in lives... Of course, it isn't put that crudely in war time. It is dressed into speeches about patriotism, love of country, and \"we must all put our shoulders to the wheel,\" but the profits jump and leap and skyrocket—and are safely pocketed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89e585ad-7787-43ac-9732-4a0a2b873955",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "The ability to shift profits to low-tax countries by locating intellectual property in them, which is then licensed to related businesses in high-tax countries, is often assumed to be the preserve of high-tech companies. […] current tax rules make it easy for all sorts of firms to generate […] “stateless income”: profit subject to tax in a jurisdiction that is neither the location of the factors of production that generate the income nor where the parent firm is domiciled."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8df9670e-d1e3-42e1-af57-a58c746af8a7",
                                                "sense_id": "1a1a5220-a2fa-31c4-a0f1-bd9ae3d18f9d",
                                                "text": "After the pandemic, MLG lost a lot of its viewership and profits which led it to close. The MLG Twitter account is no longer active and the mlg.com website directs to Battlenet instead of its old website."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                        "entry_id": "ba5bd138-66de-3752-b024-b25ff915f061",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Benefit, positive result obtained."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "literary",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b54873e0-e62e-4d87-9ab3-c155e47d8f6f",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                                "text": "Reading such an enlightening book on the subject was of much profit to his studies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3b5b52c-208f-464a-b5c1-03cd59157e93",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                                "text": "This I speak for your own profit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb838fcf-3e27-41cc-9db0-e13eafd109a5",
                                                "sense_id": "5bf7a308-fd51-3665-852e-97734c5dd38e",
                                                "text": "if you dare do yourself a profit and a right"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c02845ea-1127-3eb2-811c-171c6dba097a",
                                        "entry_id": "ba5bd138-66de-3752-b024-b25ff915f061",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of profit à prendre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "profit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d126d7b6-3d1b-39e8-8919-6f2b09b43db5",
                                        "entry_id": "0cf8c125-a520-3d10-8c9d-b7662a10bb12",
